# Generated output. Prettier must not touch these: `generate.mjs --check`
# compares the committed file byte-for-byte against a fresh generation, so a
# formatter rewriting them would make the drift gate fail on formatting rather
# than on real spec drift — and lint-staged runs `prettier --write` on every
# staged code file, so this is not hypothetical.
#
# The generator owns the formatting of what it emits (KF-S0-CONTRACT-001).
